OL,3,GNEWSATwo men arrested following high
OL,4,Astreet ram-raids
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested following
OL,7,Fram-raids in Surrey, police say.
OL,9,FFootage shared by Surrey Police on
OL,10,Fsocial media showed two police vehicles
OL,11,Fblocking in a car on Cobham High Street
OL,12,Fon Wednesday night, with one officer
OL,13,Fheard saying: "Smash it, smash it".
OL,15,FThe force said just 20 minutes earlier
OL,16,Fa car had "reversed into a string of
OL,17,Fhigh street businesses" and a person
OL,18,Fentered a shop and left with a till.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
